    ns1:quote "\"And I do think that WarioWare serves as a really useful container. It has the capacity to hold all manner of things that wouldn't normally belong together, and it allows them to mix and mingle. If ideas are fun, you can always find a place for them in a WarioWare title, even if they have no obvious connection. You always have that excuse: \"Well it is WarioWare after all!\"" ;
