dbr:Kaizo rdfs:label "Kaizo",
        "Kaizo (género de videojuegos)" ;
    dbo:description "Subgenre von Jump-’n’-Run-Videospielen",
        "genere di videogioco",
        "genre de jeu vidéo",
        "genre of difficult, modified video games",
        "género de videojuegos modificados, derivados de la franquicia de Super Mario",
        "어렵고 수정된 슈퍼 마리오 비디오 게임의 장르" ;
    ns1:author "Douglas Wilson and Miguel Sicart" ;
    ns1:text "The \"true\" game, as exemplified by games like Kaizo Mario as described above, is not about mastering the system, but about knowing the designer. Therefore, the activity of play is not instrumental or tool-oriented, but productive and oriented towards the intersubjective. Play, in our view, is only productive in dialogue." ;
    ns1:title "Now It's Personal: On Abusive Game Design" ;
