    ns1:alt "Square artwork with the game's title taking up most of the upper third of the piece. Below the title are 3D renderings of two cartoon-style video game characters, one in a green shirt and the other in a red shirt, floating above the ground in seated positions. They both are wearing blue overalls while holding white steering wheels. Directly below each character is the silhouette shadow of a small racing kart on the ground." ;
