    ns1:source "—Yoshio Sakamoto, at the 2010 Game Developers' Conference, on why he can make both Metroid games and WarioWare games; both serious and more comical games." ;
    ns1:text "It's [Nintendo's] our mission to give our images shape, which can be conveyed to other people. I want to make the game that makes the best possible reaction from my intended audience." ;
